&lt;p&gt;Strong time management skills and the ability to manage multiple projects and priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Able to thrive in a fast-paced environment and be responsive and available during high intensity moments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree degree in a quantitatively rigorous discipline like engineering, statistics, math, or economics desired&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of the fundamentals of payment processing and an understanding of industry risk trends, including familiarity with risk strategy development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
